OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after cannabis farm
OL,4,Aworth #1m found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested after
OL,7,Fpolice found a cannabis farm in south
OL,8,FShropshire containing thousands of
OL,9,Fplants that are estimated to be worth
OL,10,Fmore than #1m.
OL,12,FWest Mercia Police said a warrant was
OL,13,Fcarried out at disused farm buildings
OL,14,Fin Wall Under Heywood near Church
OL,15,FStretton on Sunday.
OL,17,FOfficers seized 1,788 plants from seven
OL,18,Frooms, and two 35-year-old men were
OL,19,Ffound inside and were arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of cultivating cannabis. A
OL,21,Fthird man, 51, was also arrested on
OL,22,Fsuspicion of the same offence.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
